{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20083","headline":"酬李侍御书记秋夕雨中病假见寄 · 孟郊","name":"酬李侍御书记秋夕雨中病假见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋风遶衰柳，远客闻雨声。\n重兹阻良夕，孤坐唯积诚。\n果枉移疾咏，中含嘉虑明。\n洗涤烦浊尽，视听昭旷生。\n未觉衾枕倦，久爲章奏婴。\n达人不宝药，所保在闲情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20083.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20083","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}